{"id":"c0d94132cfe19e7e","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-recursion-theorem.md","title":"Recursion Theorem","display":"df-recursion-theorem — Recursion Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-recursion-theorem","aliases":["88-df-recursion-theorem"],"display":"df-recursion-theorem — Recursion Theorem","depends_on":["[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-recursion-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-recursion-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursion-theorem — Recursion Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-recursion-theorem-—-Recursion-Theorem-(Kleene)\">df-recursion-theorem — Recursion Theorem (Kleene)</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\geq1}\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\geq1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\">\\(\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a> 的固定编号环境。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 是候选程序索引变换；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KFP}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{KFP}(f)\\)</span> 是相对于该固定编号环境的固定点性质。</li>\n<li>等号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e=\\varphi_{f(e)}\">\\(\\varphi_e=\\varphi_{f(e)}\\)</span> 是部分函数图相等，不是两个程序码相等。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KFP}(f)\\leftrightarrow\nf:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\n\\land\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\varphi_e=\\varphi_{f(e)}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KFP}(f)\\leftrightarrow\nf:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\n\\land\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\varphi_e=\\varphi_{f(e)}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件只定义“给定总索引变换具有外延固定点”。可计算性、编号可接受性及参数固化能力不是该性质的定义部分；它们是保证性质成立的定理假设。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}\">\\(\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}\\)</span> 已从定义中移除，而不是删除其在证明中的作用。</p>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"96267a91020ab600\" href=\"?note=96267a91020ab600\" title=\"88-lem-recursion\">88-lem-recursion</a> 明确使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 前提推出固定点；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"75e301ab0a784049\" href=\"?note=75e301ab0a784049\" title=\"88-thm-kleene-recursion\">88-thm-kleene-recursion</a> 再由可接受编号推出该前提。因此性质、足够条件与存在性定理不再混在一个定义式里。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-recursion-theorem-—-Recursion-Theorem-(Kleene)","text":"df-recursion-theorem — Recursion Theorem (Kleene)","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-effective-program-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"b955b7851c500bfe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\geq1}$、$\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}$ 是 [[88-df-effective-program-numbering]] 的固定编号环境。","embed":false},{"target":"88-lem-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"96267a91020ab600","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[88-lem-recursion]] 明确使用 $s$-$m$-$n$ 前提推出固定点；[[88-thm-kleene-recursion]] 再由可接受编号推出该前提。因此性质、足够条件与存在性定理不再混在一个定义式里。","embed":false},{"target":"88-thm-kleene-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"75e301ab0a784049","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[88-lem-recursion]] 明确使用 $s$-$m$-$n$ 前提推出固定点；[[88-thm-kleene-recursion]] 再由可接受编号推出该前提。因此性质、足够条件与存在性定理不再混在一个定义式里。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\varphi=(\\Phi_k)_{k\\geq1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e=\\varphi_e^{(1)}","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KFP}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_e=\\varphi_{f(e)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{KFP}(f)\\leftrightarrow\nf:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\n\\land\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\varphi_e=\\varphi_{f(e)}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":1381,"backlinks":[{"id":"96267a91020ab600","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Comp}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]；$\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}$ 见 [[88-df-smn-theorem]]；$\\mathrm{KFP}$ 见 [[88-df-recursion-theorem]]；$\\simeq$ 见 [[88-df-kleene-equality]]。"},{"id":"75e301ab0a784049","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)$ 见 [[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]；$\\mathrm{Comp}_1$ 见 [[88-df-computable-function]]；$\\mathrm{KFP}$ 见 [[88-df-recursion-theorem]]。"},{"id":"0d1300ef33ffd8df","anchor":"ref-119","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[88-df-recursion-theorem]]"},{"id":"27b8db839bec5892","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-ackermann-function.md]]\n[[88-df-alphabet.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-delta.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-full.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-pi.md]]\n[[88-df-arithmetical-hierarchy-sigma.md]]\n[[88-df-assignment.md]]\n[[88-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-axiom.md]]\n[[88-df-bijective.md]]\n[[88-df-bound-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[88-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[88-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-indexing.md]]\n[[88-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[88-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[88-df-classical-calculus.md]]\n[[88-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[88-df-compactness.md]]\n[[88-df-completeness.md]]\n[[88-df-computable-function.md]]\n[[88-df-consistent.md]]\n[[88-df-countable.md]]\n[[88-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[88-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[88-df-defined.md]]\n[[88-df-delta0-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-delta1-set.md]]\n[[88-df-derivation.md]]\n[[88-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[88-df-effective-join.md]]\n[[88-df-effective-program-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-elementary-equivalence.md]]\n[[88-df-elementary-substructure.md]]\n[[88-df-encoding.md]]\n[[88-df-finite-extension.md]]\n[[88-df-first-incompleteness.md]]\n[[88-df-formula.md]]\n[[88-df-free-variable.md]]\n[[88-df-function.md]]\n[[88-df-function-recursive.md]]\n[[88-df-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[88-df-godel-sentence.md]]\n[[88-df-halting-problem.md]]\n[[88-df-halting-set.md]]\n[[88-df-hyperarithmetical.md]]\n[[88-df-hyperarithmetical-def.md]]\n[[88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[88-df-incompleteness-theorems.md]]\n[[88-df-index-set.md]]\n[[88-df-inductive-definition.md]]\n[[88-df-infe